  "honestNativeGap": "Layer 1 has no HTTP client or credential resolver. Fixture, recording, loopback, and BLOCKED_ENV never report Connected or native. Layer 2 may add consented stream effects, durable receipts, and independent lag reconciliation only under a separate authority boundary."
